# Generated by `rustory gen-assets`; the generator is the source of truth.
/assets

# Default output of `rustory shot`.
/shot.png

# Local working notes, deliberately not tracked.
#
# AGENTS.md is the operating standard for this checkout: it may name local paths
# and machine specifics, and it is written for whoever (or whatever) works here
# rather than for a public audience.
#
# HANDOFF.md is background context for a session picking the work up.
#
# Neither is authoritative on architecture: docs/adr/ is the single record of
# design decisions, versioned and reviewed. Anything that must outlive one machine
# belongs there, not in these files.
/AGENTS.md
/HANDOFF.md

# Crash-recovery copies written beside a story while it has unsaved changes.
# Working files, like target/: recoverable, not deliverables.
*.draft.ron